---
---

<section class="contato-section" id="contato">
  <header class="contato-header">
    <h2>Entre em Contato</h2>
    <p>Fique à vontade para enviar uma mensagem ou usar os canais abaixo para falar diretamente comigo.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="contato-info">
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:luciano@email.com">luciano@email.com</a></p>
    <p><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/5581999999999" target="_blank">+55 81 99999-9999</a></p>
    <p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/luciano-dev" target="_blank">linkedin.com/in/luciano-dev</a></p>
    <p><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/luciano-dev" target="_blank">github.com/luciano-dev</a></p>
  </div>

  <form class="contato-form" name="contato" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contato" />

    <label>
      Nome
      <input type="text" name="nome" required />
    </label>

    <label>
      E-mail
      <input type="email" name="email" required />
    </label>

    <label>
      Mensagem
      <textarea name="mensagem" rows="5" required></textarea>
    </label>

    <button type="submit">Enviar</button>
  </form>
</section>

<style>
  .contato-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem;
  }

  .contato-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .contato-header h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .contato-header p {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .contato-info {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .contato-info p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .contato-info a {
    color: #38bdf8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contato-info a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .contato-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .contato-form label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .contato-form input,
  .contato-form textarea {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: none;
    background: #1e293b;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .contato-form button {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: #38bdf8;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: bold;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contato-form button:hover {
    background: #0ea5e9;
  }
</style>